- `ai_costs`: SELECT (owner/admin only). No INSERT from app — service_role only.
- `ai_voice_profiles`: SELECT (any studio member). No INSERT/UPDATE from app — service_role only.
- `ai_drafts`: SELECT (any studio member) + UPDATE for status transitions (owner/admin/artist). No INSERT — service_role only.

